# Ported from the live Vercel origin (usedayspring.app) and site/vercel.json.
# vercel.json has no headers block; these are the headers Vercel currently
# sends on static responses. Cloudflare already defaults Cache-Control to
# `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate` — restated so the port is explicit.
#
# Do not invent extra security headers here. PostHog / Google Ads / Meta
# tags (when present) must keep loading from their existing origins.

/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
